{"title":"Exposure Joystick 19 Gets Mega 33% Output Boost with Same Runtime, in Same Small Size","link":"https://bikerumor.com/exposure-joystick-mk19-compact-1600lm-cycling-headlight/","date":1794510000000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-cycling-light-with-higher-1600lm-output_mk18-on-helmet-1536x1024.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"&lt;i&gt;(Photo/Cory Benson)&lt;/i&gt;\" /></p>\n<p>Exposure once again gives their popular lightweight Joystick helmet light a big upgrade – this time boosting output to 1600 lumens for its 19th generation. On the gunmetal grey anodized outside, it looks exactly the same as the outgoing model – outside of a couple extra cooling fins. But inside, there’s a more powerful LED, the same battery which gets the same burn times, and a reshaped lens for improved peripheral vision when night riding.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Upgraded 2026 Exposure Joystick mk19 1600lm helmet light</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty.jpg\"><img width=\"2400\" height=\"1350\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty.jpg\" alt=\"2026 new Exposure Joystick 19 compact helmet cycling headlight gets 1600lm upgrade\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty.jpg 2400w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty-297x167.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty-120x68.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty-768x432.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_tiny-but-mighty-1600x900.jpg 1600w\" /></a><figcaption><i>(All studio photos/Exposure)</i></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Just last fall, Exposure’s long-running and most-popular helmet light – the tiny Joystick – got a pretty significant <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/exposure-boosts-light-output-fast-charging-for-coming-darkness-plus-color-oled-more/\" target=\"_blank\">18th-generation performance upgrade</a>. That one added hands-free TAP tech to be able to switch modes without searching for a tiny button while riding. You can even set it so you just tap your helmet to change modes. Plus, it added an extra 50lm of light output and a 4% bigger battery to keep the same runtime.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Now, Exposure have an even bigger update for the Joystick mk19.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-up-close.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1500\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-up-close.jpg\" alt=\"2026 new Exposure Joystick 19 compact helmet cycling headlight gets 1600lm upgrade: new dimpled lens detail\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-up-close.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-up-close-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-up-close-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-up-close-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-up-close-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-up-close-1200x900.jpg 1200w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This time, it gets 400 lumens more, bringing its peak output to 1600lm with an upgraded lens. Typically, the Joystick would often be used as a helmet-mounted light to combine with a bar light for off-road riding. But this big output increase is enough to use it on its own, too – on your head or handlebar – for less intense night riding like gravel or bikepacking. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>That’s especially good news, because I’ve found Exposure lights to be extremely high-quality and long-lasting, but they aren’t exactly cheap. Now, one tiny light can double as a helmet light for fast technical mountain bike, but also offer plenty of illumination from your bar for less demanding singletrack or gravel road riding, or even commuting.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>And it’s just as small as ever. 112mm long and a max 30mm in diameter at its head. It is again a few grams heavier, now up to 111g to account for a slightly heavier, high-capacity battery tucked inside.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Tech details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled.jpg\"><img width=\"2400\" height=\"1349\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled.jpg\" alt=\"2026 new Exposure Joystick 19 compact helmet cycling headlight gets 1600lm upgrade: angled\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled.jpg 2400w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled-297x167.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled-1536x863.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled-120x67.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled-768x432.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled-2048x1151.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_new-lens-angled-1600x900.jpg 1600w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>compact mini flashlight-style cycling headlight</li>\n\n\n\n<li>CNC-machined 6063 alloy housing with integrated heatsink fins</li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>1600 lumen</em> max output, up 33% from mk18</li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>new</em> single white XHP50 Cree LED for bright, clear illumination</li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>new</em> dimpled lens design for improved peripheral visibility</li>\n\n\n\n<li>various helmet, bar, or any GoPro mount compatible with various clip-on holders</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_case-included.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_case-included.jpg\" alt=\"2026 new Exposure Joystick 19 compact helmet cycling headlight gets 1600lm upgrade: package contents, includes case and Helmet Mount with Action Camera Clip, plus security strap\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_case-included.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_case-included-297x178.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_case-included-1536x922.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_case-included-120x72.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_case-included-768x461.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_case-included-1500x900.jpg 1500w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Action Clip with screw-on Helmet Mount included (with 2 bolt lengths) allows GoPro mount compatibility</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Security Leash also included</li>\n\n\n\n<li>bar, cleat, out-front, and braze-on mounts available separately</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body.jpg\"><img width=\"1800\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body.jpg\" alt=\"2026 new Exposure Joystick 19 compact helmet cycling headlight gets 1600lm upgrade: 6x 2-3 output modes\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body.jpg 1800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_light-modes-laser-etched-on-alloy-body-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>1-36 hours of runtime in about a dozen different output modes<br />(6 sets of modes, with individual High, Medium &amp; Low settings)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>same</em> 400mAh battery inside</li>\n\n\n\n<li>1-button setup &amp; control, with simple 3-color LED indicator on the back of the light</li>\n\n\n\n<li>TAP tech hands-free adjustment</li>\n\n\n\n<li>USB-C charging in ~2hrs, can be continuously charged while illuminating from most power banks</li>\n\n\n\n<li>IP67 waterproofing for use in all weather conditions &amp; IK09 impact rating</li>\n\n\n\n<li>111g claimed weight</li>\n\n\n\n<li>UK-made in West Sussex, England</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Exposure warranties all lights for 2 years, 3 years if bought direct from their website, LEDs guaranteed for life</li>\n\n\n\n<li>designed to work for many years, Exposure also services (and can sometimes update) previous-generation lights for much longer</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>Exposure Joystick 19 – Pricing &amp; availability</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-scaled.jpg\"><img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"2026 new Exposure Joystick 19 compact helmet cycling headlight gets 1600lm upgrade: on included mount\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-Exposure-Joystick-19-compact-1600lm-helmet-light-cycling-headlight_with-included-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The new, higher-output Exposure Joystick 19 sells for $215 / £195 / 195€. That’s exactly the same price as the Joystick 18, which I personally use on my helmet for nighttime trail riding together with a bar light. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-light-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-up-close.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-light-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-up-close.jpg\" alt=\"2026 Exposure Joystick 19 compact 1600lm helmet light cycling headlight: versatile Helmet Mount with Action Cam Clip\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-light-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-up-close.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-light-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-up-close-297x178.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-light-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-up-close-1536x922.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-light-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-up-close-120x72.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-light-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-up-close-768x461.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-light-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-up-close-1500x900.jpg 1500w\" /></a><figcaption>my Joystick 18 with the Helmet Mount with Action Camera Clip <i>(Photo/Cory Benson)</i></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>I’m really happy with Exposure’s move to their new ‘Helmet Mount with Action Camera Clip’ that allows easy mounting to the top of a helmet, as long as it has a central vent on top. But also the fact that you can take the helmet mount plates off, and bolt it onto any GoPro-style mount, too. I also like the simple rubber band Quick Release Handlebar Mount, which will cost you an extra 15€ to quickly clip it onto a round handlebar.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip.jpg\" alt=\"2026 Exposure Joystick 19 compact 1600lm helmet light cycling headlight: mk18 on helmet\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Exposure-upgrades-popular-Joystick-helmet-light-with-higher-output_mk18-on-Helmet-Mount-with-Action-Camera-Clip-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a><figcaption><i>(Photo/Cory Benson)</i></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Get yours now, directly from Exposure’s website or their global retailer network.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.exposurelights.com/\" target=\"_blank\">ExposureLights.com</a></em></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>","author":"Cory Benson","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/exposure-joystick-mk19-compact-1600lm-cycling-headlight/#comments","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"488f3f4a22d92ab1886ae351ce2b65bf0a9a4f1f0de8e0ed4b041c338cf7fc0b","category":"Cycling"}